  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU Twinning Skatteverket Bosnien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Twinning Swedish Tax Agency Bosnie - EU Twinning Swedish Tax Agency Bosnien- fas 1b (P&#xc5;G&#xc5;ENDE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med Skatteverkets insats &#xe4;r att harmonisera skattelagstiftningen i enlighet med EU:s regelverk och kunna till&#xe4;mpa best practices g&#xe4;llande indirekt beskattning. 

Skatteverket har som intention att ta lead role i twinninginsatsen och samarbeta med Finland som kommer ha en junior roll. 

Insatsen har som ambition att bidra till att uppn&#xe5; SDG-m&#xe5;l 8 Anst&#xe4;ndiga arbetsvillkor och ekonomisk tillv&#xe4;xt, m&#xe5;l 16 Fred, r&#xe4;ttvisa och st&#xe4;rkta institutioner samt 17 Globalt partnerskap.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Swedish Tax Agency&#x2019;s initiative is to harmonize tax legislation in accordance with EU regulations and to apply best practices in the field of indirect taxation.

The Swedish Tax Agency intends to take a leading role in the twinning project and collaborate with Finland, which will have a junior role.

The initiative aims to contribute to achieving SDG Goal 8 (Decent Work and Economic Growth), Goal 16 (Peace, Justice and Strong Institutions), and Goal 17 (Partnerships for the Goals).</narrative>
  </description>
